-|-------------|--------------|-------------|----------|--------------|
-| **STAGING** (default) | shared project `<project-ref>` | `<project-ref>` | `.env.local`, `.env.staging`, `.env.test` | **All day-to-day development.** Migrations, edge functions, task DB, CLI (`--linked`) all target the shared project. |
